00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:15.560
the V tile is not loaded and kind of in the context kernels most of the time.

375
00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:16.480
I think I mentioned before,

376
00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:20.280
we just don't bother doing this because the extra extra weighting is not worth it.

